{"benchmark": "ifeval", "task_id": "1069", "sample_idx": 38, "model_name": "meta/llama-4-maverick-17b-128e-instruct", "content": "Subject: Invitation to Meeting on New Project Development\n\nDear Team\n\nI am writing to inform you that we will be holding a meeting on the new project that we have been working on for the past few weeks. The meeting will take place on Friday at 2 PM in the conference room on the second floor of our office building. I expect all team members to be present as we will be discussing the latest developments and future plans for the project.\n\nAs you are aware our team has been working tirelessly to bring this project to life and I am pleased to say that we have made significant progress so far. The data we have collected so far indicates that the results are correlated with our initial projections and we are on track to meet our targets. I am confident that with the collective effort of our team we will be able to deliver a high-quality product that meets the expectations of our clients.\n\nThe meeting will be a great opportunity for us to discuss the challenges we are experiencing and come up with solutions to overcome them. We will also be discussing the resource allocation and making sure that we have the necessary tools and personnel to complete the project on time. I encourage all team members to come prepared with their ideas and suggestions as we will be brainstorming and making key decisions during the meeting.\n\nThe agenda for the meeting will include a review of the current project status an update on the timeline and milestones a discussion on the budget and resource allocation and a review of the risks and challenges associated with the project. We will also be discussing the marketing strategy and how we plan to launch the product once it is complete.\n\nI believe that this meeting is crucial to the success of our project and I look forward to seeing you all there. I am confident that with our collective effort and dedication we will be able to deliver a product that exceeds the expectations of our clients. The meeting will be a great opportunity for us to come together as a team and work towards a common goal.\n\nIn preparation for the meeting I request that all team members review the project documents and come prepared with their questions and concerns. We will also be having a Q&A session during the meeting where you can ask questions and clarify any doubts you may have.\n\nI am excited to see the progress we have made so far and I am confident that we will be able to overcome the challenges we are experiencing and deliver a successful product. The meeting will be a great opportunity for us to discuss the project's progress and make key decisions that will drive the project forward.\n\nThe meeting will start at 2 PM sharp and I request that all team members be punctual. We will be having a short break during the meeting to refresh and recharge. I encourage all team members to participate actively in the discussions and share their thoughts and ideas.\n\nThank you for your hard work and dedication to this project. I look forward to seeing you all at the meeting on Friday.\n\nBest regards\n[Your Name]", "logprobs": [{"token": "Subject", "logprob": -0.12693004310131073}, {"token": ":", "logprob": -0.0020888668950647116}, {"token": " Inv", "logprob": -0.007055842317640781}, {"token": "itation", "logprob": 0.0}, {"token": " to", "logprob": 0.0}, {"token": " Meeting", "logprob": -0.046967510133981705}, {"token": " on", "logprob": -0.3153541684150696}, {"token": " New", "logprob": -1.7195802927017212}, {"token": " Project", "logprob": -0.20344005525112152}, {"token": " Development", "logprob": -1.5873140096664429}, {"token": "\n\n", "logprob": -0.00011693747364915907}, {"token": "Dear", "logprob": 0.0}, {"token": " Team", "logprob": -0.10645109415054321}, {"token": "\n\n", "logprob": -0.974077045917511}, {"token": "I", "logprob": -0.12693803012371063}, {"token": " am", "logprob": -0.018149